# Keep every text file LF in the working tree, on every OS.
#
# Windows checkouts default to `core.autocrlf=true`, which rewrites the tree to
# CRLF. Biome is configured for LF, so without this a Windows contributor's very
# first `bun run lint` reports every line of every file as changed — and any
# `lint:fix` would commit a whole-repo line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff2 binary
